/highlight> a thing, followed by participle (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:120b»§ 120b</sup>), <bdbheb>שׁוֺדֵד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 33:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,1)\">Isa 33:1</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>complete, sum up</highlight>, with accusative money <ref ref=\"2Kgs 22:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,22,4)\">2Kgs 22:4</ref> (other conjectures <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gr')\">Gr</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Gi</lookup>); transgressions <ref ref=\"Dan 8:23\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,23)\">Dan 8:23</ref> sin <ref ref=\"Dan 9:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,24)\">Dan 9:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>חתם</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>destroy</highlight> uncleanness, with <bdbheb>מן</bdbheb> <highlight>from</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,15)\">Ezek 22:15</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> causative (of <b>Qal 6</b>): accusative <bdbheb>דרכיך</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 22:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,3)\">Job 22:3</ref> <highlight>make sound thy ways.</highlight> <b>Hithpa`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תִּתַּמָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:26\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,26)\">2Sam 22:26</ref>, with <bdbheb>עִם</bdbheb> <highlight>deal in integrity with</highlight> = <ref ref=\"Ps 18:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,26)